59
00:03:54,340 --> 00:03:57,560
Now this is a critical part of your motion graphics with Claude.

60
00:03:57,560 --> 00:04:02,720
Before you go and animate anything, you need to ask Claude to create a numbered storyboard

61
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:08,020
